&lt;p&gt;spark_2.10:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;1. master - 9 test passed - &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=1098512&amp;amp;tab=buildResultsDiv&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_IgniteRddSpark210&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=1098512&amp;amp;tab=buildResultsDiv&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_IgniteRddSpark210&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
